nction).","status":"confirmed"}},{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-9ABD","via":"bin/omarchy-menu-handshake:wait_for_menu_done"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"input:52-64 mirrors select: pid lookup, then a summon exit-status check, then wait_for_menu_done. A wait that gives up returns exit 1 with no output, which is what 9ABD specifies for a cancel. 9ABD's external_call_timeout_bounded cell is observed_pass (menu-dmenu-test.sh:250). 9ABD shows as 'modified' only because its YAML (traces and verification state) changed on the mirror; its description and FRETish are unchanged.","refs":[{"id":"bin/omarchy-menu-input","kind":"file","line":52},{"id":"bin/omarchy-menu-input","kind":"file","line":62},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-dmenu-test.sh","kind":"file","line":250},{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-9ABD","kind":"requirement"},{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-MP00","kind":"requirement"}],"severity":"info","title":"omarchy-menu-input gets the same bounded wait (SW-REQ-260922-9ABD)","verification":{"evidence":[{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-9ABD","kind":"requirement"}],"method":"review.changes (spec, code-trace, function and call-level requirement impact)","note":"SW-REQ-260922-9ABD is in review.changes (modified, matchLevel function).","status":"confirmed"}},{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-MH9B","via":"bin/omarchy-menu-handshake:wait_for_menu_done"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"images:432 resolves the shell pid before the image-selector open. The existing `open_result != \"ok\"` check stays (images:449). wait_for_menu_done runs with interval 0.01 (images:454). MH9B's external_call_timeout_bounded cell is observed_pass (menu-images-test.sh:641, stand-in shell killed after the open). Its error_handling cell is suppressed by a base-data suppression.","refs":[{"id":"bin/omarchy-menu-images","kind":"file","line":432},{"id":"bin/omarchy-menu-images","kind":"file","line":449},{"id":"bin/omarchy-menu-images","kind":"file","line":454},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-image